          ],
          "content": "**Page No. 163**"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.117,
            0.313,
            0.136
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "？ Figure it out"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.147,
            0.881,
            0.213
          ],
          "content": "**1. For each of the following angles, find another angle for which a triangle is (a) possible, (b) not possible. Find at least two different angles for each category:**"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
            0.215,
            0.874,
            0.569
          ],
          "content": "|  | Triangle is possible | Triangle is not possible |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| (a)30° | Another angle should be less than 150°. It could be 50°or 90°. Find the third angle in each case. | Another angle should be greater than or equal to 150°. It could be 150°or 170°. |\n| (b)70° | Another angle should be less than 110°. It could be 60°or 80°. Find the third angle in each case. | Another angle should be greater than or equal to 110°. It could be 140°or 120°. |\n| (c)54° | Another angle should be less than 126°. It could be 90°or 64°. Find the third angle in each case. | Another angle should be greater than or equal to 126°. It could be 134°or 154°. |\n| (d)144° | Another angle should be less than 36°. It could be 20°or 35°. Find the third angle in each case. | Another angle should be greater than or equal to 36°. It could be 36°or 90°. |",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_31_table_3.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.577,
            0.881,
            0.62
          ],
          "content": "2. **Determine which of the following pairs can be the angles of a triangle and which cannot:**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.173,
            0.629,
            0.3,
            0.648
          ],
          "content": "**(a) 35°, 150°**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.172,
            0.652,
            0.64,
            0.672
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** This pair cannot form angles of a triangle."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.69,
            0.29,
            0.708
          ],
          "content": "**(b) 70°, 30°**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.172,
            0.713,
            0.711,
            0.734
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** This pair of angles can be the angles of a triangle."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.178,
            0.75,
            0.293,
            0.769
          ],
          "content": "**(c) 90°, 85°**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.172,
            0.774,
            0.712,
            0.794
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** This pair of angles can be the angles of a triangle."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.173,
            0.811,
            0.301,
            0.83
          ],
          "content": "**(d) 50°, 150°**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.172,
            0.835,
            0.641,
            0.855
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** This pair cannot form angles of a triangle."
